  <section>
    <p class="post-lead"><strong>Short answer:</strong> Telegram's official withdrawal is only open to channel owners, bot developers and creators who <em>earned</em> Stars, and it runs through Fragment in TON with a 21-day holding period. If you simply have Stars sitting in your balance, there is no official way to turn them into money; they are meant to be spent inside Telegram. StarsJoy does not buy Stars. It only sells Stars, Premium and gifts.</p>
